# Uniform reactions (D-360, docs/reputation_dialogue.md): people the player knew before the uniform, the
# Draconid village and townsfolk see the TEAM MAGMA uniform; a gift-giver says the uniform line and then gives
# the vanilla item; outside the uniform the same person falls back to vanilla, after the turn to the revealed
# line. Needs rustboro_done.ss from tests/rustboro.play (the player in uniform). Each talk: the warp puts the
# player next to the person (and waits out the fade), a press turns towards them, A talks and expect_text checks
# the text shown.
loadstate rustboro_done.ss
setflag FLAG_DEBUG_NO_ENCOUNTER
setflag FLAG_DEBUG_NO_TRAINER_SEE
expect_var VAR_DRACONID_REPUTATION 1

# --- Route 101: the youngster who saw PROF. BIRCH's rescue recognises the player
warp MAP_ROUTE101 16 9
run 150
press UP 2 20
press A 2 60
shot u01_route101_youngster
expect_text Route101_Text_DraconidRepYoungsterUniform
mash A 600

# --- the Draconid village knows why the player wears red
warp MAP_DRACONID_VILLAGE 21 25
run 150
press RIGHT 2 20
press A 2 60
shot u02_gatekeeper
expect_text DraconidVillage_Text_DraconidRepGatekeeperUniform
mash A 600
warp MAP_DRACONID_VILLAGE_HOUSE1 4 5
run 150
press UP 2 20
press A 2 60
shot u03_weaver
expect_text DraconidVillage_House1_Text_DraconidRepWeaverUniform
mash A 600

# --- Petalburg: a Mart customer and a Pokémon Center visitor
warp MAP_PETALBURG_CITY_MART 4 5
run 150
press RIGHT 2 20
press A 2 60
shot u04_petalburg_mart
expect_text PetalburgCity_Mart_Text_DraconidRepWomanUniform
mash A 600
warp MAP_PETALBURG_CITY_POKEMON_CENTER_1F 2 4
run 150
press UP 2 20
press A 2 60
shot u05_petalburg_pc
expect_text PetalburgCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_DraconidRepFatManUniform
mash A 600

# --- Rustboro: a child at home, and the teacher, whose QUICK CLAW still comes after the uniform line
warp MAP_RUSTBORO_CITY_HOUSE2 3 5
run 150
press RIGHT 2 20
press A 2 60
shot u06_rustboro_house
expect_text RustboroCity_House2_Text_DraconidRepLittleGirlUniform
mash A 600
expect_item ITEM_QUICK_CLAW 0
# (his desk is in front of him: talk from the west, so he walks round the class before the vanilla line)
warp MAP_RUSTBORO_CITY_POKEMON_SCHOOL 4 3
run 150
press RIGHT 2 20
press A 2 60
shot u07_teacher
expect_text RustboroCity_PokemonSchool_Text_DraconidRepTeacherUniform
# (the uniform line: a box, a two-line box and a scroll; then the vanilla script takes over)
run 150
press A 2 150
press A 2 150
press A 2 150
press A 2 400
shot u07b_vanilla
expect_text RustboroCity_PokemonSchool_Text_StudentsWhoDontStudyGetQuickClaw
mash A 3000
shot u08_quick_claw
expect_item ITEM_QUICK_CLAW 1

# --- the same youngster outside the uniform: vanilla before it, the revealed line after the turn
setvar VAR_DRACONID_REPUTATION 0
warp MAP_ROUTE101 16 9
run 150
press UP 2 20
press A 2 60
expect_text Route101_Text_TakeTiredPokemonToPokeCenter
mash A 600
setvar VAR_DRACONID_REPUTATION 2
press UP 2 20
press A 2 60
shot u09_revealed
expect_text Route101_Text_DraconidRepYoungsterRevealed
mash A 600
setvar VAR_DRACONID_REPUTATION 1
clearflag FLAG_DEBUG_NO_ENCOUNTER
clearflag FLAG_DEBUG_NO_TRAINER_SEE
